---
import { LAYERS } from '../../../home/journey/layers';
---

<div data-fig data-kind="reveal" class="grid w-full place-items-center">
  <div
    data-reveal-frame
    class="w-full max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-crust shadow-floating"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-panel px-3 py-2">
      <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-surface1"></span>
      <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-surface1"></span>
      <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-surface1"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-0.5 text-2xs text-subtext0"
        >https://wandres.dev</span
      >
    </div>

    <div class="px-6 py-7">
      <p class="m-0 text-2xs tracking-smallcaps text-subtext0 uppercase">
        centro de estudios · ciencias de la computación
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-headline text-text">
        Los frameworks caducan.<br /><span class="text-mauve">Los fundamentos no.</span>
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        {
          LAYERS.map((l) => (
            <span
              data-reveal-chip
              class="rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs text-subtext0"
            >
              {l.id}
            </span>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-medida text-sm text-subtext0">
        La máquina que acabas de montar está ejecutando el navegador que pinta esta página.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
